  "description": "⭐ <span>This is Chardonnay as it should be experienced - generous pours, a relaxed pace, Michelin-level food and time to truly savour the nuance of the world's most versatile grape. Come curious. Leave inspired.</span><br><br><strong>Highlights</strong><br> 🥂 Begin with a glass (or two?) of Champagne<br> 🍷 Enjoy 125ml pours of each wine, to compare one to the other throughout the evening - yes, that means multiple glasses at every seat.<br> 🍇 <span>From the refined elegance of Maison Champagne Poirot and Louis Jadot to the vibrant expressions of Errazuriz, Zuccardi, Villa Maria and Résonance</span><br>🍴 Savour a generous portions of seven types of seasonal canapés crafted under the direction of Executive Chef Rob Weston<br> 📝 Take notes, exchange opinions on the wine, meet new friends and maybe even order a case of your favourite wines to enjoy at home.<br> ✨ Hosted in an intimate private dining space to enjoy the experience among friends old and new<br><br><strong>General Info</strong><br> 📅 Dates: 26 August 2026<br> 🕒 Time: 6:30 PM – 10 PM<br> ⏳ Duration: 3.5 hours&nbsp;<br> 📍 Location: Vinoly, Marylebone - <span>33 Aybrook St, </span><span>W1U 4AP</span><br> 👤 Age requirement: 18+ with valid ID<br> ♿ Accessibility: the venue is not wheelchair accessible<br> ❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vRkiUopMfSdsdbppXhJEoYH0UjxPEpOCfLiQlUz_mXnamZzM4qINll6COjtsxfioWtrgyDi92wwYN7q/pub\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br><br><strong>Description</strong><br><span>This is Chardonnay as it should be experienced: generous servings in premium glassware, among beautiful surroundings, and with plenty of time to savour every nuance.</span><br><span>Whether you’re a wine connoisseur or simply looking for a sophisticated night out, </span><em>Chardonnay Unlocked</em><span> offers a unique opportunity to explore continents, climates, and styles through the world’s most versatile grape.&nbsp;</span>Accompanied by seasonal canapés throughout the evening, you’ll journey from the refined elegance of Maison Champagne Poirot and Louis Jadot to the vibrant expressions of Errazuriz, Zuccardi, Villa Maria and Résonance, rediscovering just how alluring Chardonnay can be. <br><span>This is an evening you'll be talking about.</span><br><br><strong>About Encountr</strong><br><span>Encountr designs evenings that feel different. Not through novelty - but through care. Exceptional wines, beautiful food, curious people. No pretension. Every event is deliberately small and personal in feel.</span><br>",
